hy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>×</mo></mstyle></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
