    "q-174408": {
      "dom_id": "step-q174408",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Find the disjoint union of the sets $\\{x,y,z\\}$ and $\\{u,v,w\\}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that the sets are disjoint since\n\n$$\n\\{x,y,z\\}\\cap \\{u,v,w\\}=∅.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the disjoint union is simply the union:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{x,y,z\\}⊔\\{u,v,w\\} & =\\{x,y,z\\}\\cup \\{u,v,w\\} \\\\  & =\\{u,v,w,x,y,z\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
