d><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">△</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>◻</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">△</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>◻</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
